WEBVTT

1
00:00:05,390 --> 00:00:07,860
To puke up the baby

2
00:00:07,860 --> 00:00:08,860
Uncle, give me another fifty yuan

3
00:00:08,860 --> 00:00:11,180
I guarantee you real food

4
00:00:11,180 --> 00:00:14,200
Please give in. You are quite an adult.

5
00:00:14,200 --> 00:00:20,420
You still care about our children, baby?

6
00:00:20,420 --> 00:00:21,380
It depends on uncle

7
00:00:21,380 --> 00:00:24,060
The baby's last name is Rainbow Dash

8
00:00:24,060 --> 00:00:27,020
He is one and eight years old this year

9
00:00:27,020 --> 00:00:30,820
Not yet two years old, so young

10
00:00:30,820 --> 00:00:32,420
A cup of coffee costs more than two hundred

11
00:00:32,420 --> 00:00:33,620
Why hasn’t Yun’s wife come yet?

12
00:00:33,620 --> 00:00:35,580
I have tattoos all over my body and I won’t come back without you

13
00:00:35,580 --> 00:00:36,700
I opened the door of this store today

14
00:00:36,700 --> 00:00:44,980
I can't even get out, brother, baby

15
00:00:44,980 --> 00:00:51,170
Baby catches Rainbow Dash

16
00:00:51,170 --> 00:00:52,170
I'll press it later

17
00:00:52,210 --> 00:01:02,280
Just press the red button kid

18
00:01:02,280 --> 00:01:04,710
You just said your surname is Mu

19
00:01:04,710 --> 00:01:06,070
Brother does not curse

20
00:01:06,070 --> 00:01:09,910
Baby, play, uncle

21
00:01:09,910 --> 00:01:11,150
Please tell grandpa

22
00:01:11,150 --> 00:01:12,270
I'll go back later
